      "body": "## Finding description and impact\n\nAttacker Steals Accrued Launchpad Fees via Phantom Liquidity Mint/Burn (Reserves Exclude Fees While Balances Include Them)\n\n**Root Cause**: In `_update` (lines 184-185), reserves are set to `balance - totalLaunchpadFee` to exclude accrued fees, but actual token balances still hold the fees. `mint` (lines 215-216) detects this excess as \"added liquidity\" without requiring transfers, minting free LP tokens proportional to the fees. `burn` (lines 248-249) then extracts the fees pro-rata from full balances (including excesses), stealing them before distribution.\n\nhttps://github.com/code-423n4/2025-08-gte-perps/blob/f43e1eedb65e7e0327cfaf4d7608a37d85d2fae7/contracts/launchpad/uniswap/GTELaunchpadV2Pair.sol#L185-L188\n\n```solidity\nFile: 2025-08-gte-perps-2/contracts/launchpad/uniswap/GTELaunchpadV2Pair.sol\n211:     function mint(address to) external lock returns (uint256 liquidity) {\n212:         (uint112 _reserve0, uint112 _reserve1,) = getReserves(); // gas savings\n213:         uint256 balance0 = IERC20(token0).balanceOf(address(this));\n214:         uint256 balance1 = IERC20(token1).balanceOf(address(this));\n215:  >>>    uint256 amount0 = balance0.sub(_reserve0);\n216:  >>>    uint256 amount1 = balance1.sub(_reserve1);\n217: \n218:         bool feeOn = _mintFee(_reserve0, _reserve1);\n219:         uint256 _totalSupply = totalSupply; // gas savings, must be defined here since totalSupply can update in _mintFee\n220:         if (_totalSupply == 0) {\n221:             liquidity = Math.sqrt(amount0.mul(amount1)).sub(MINIMUM_LIQUIDITY);\n222:             _mint(address(0), MINIMUM_LIQUIDITY); // permanently lock the first MINIMUM_LIQUIDITY tokens\n223:         } else {\n224:  >>>        liquidity = Math.min(amount0.mul(_totalSupply) / _reserve0, amount1.mul(_totalSupply) / _reserve1);\n225:         }\n226:         if (liquidity == 0) revert(\"UniswapV2: INSUFFICIENT_LIQUIDITY_MINTED\");\n227:         _mint(to, liquidity);\n228: \n229:         _update(balance0, balance1, _reserve0, _reserve1, uint112(0), uint112(0));\n230:         if (feeOn) kLast = uint256(reserve0).mul(reserve1); // reserve0 and reserve1 are up-to-date\n231:         emit Mint(msg.sender, amount0, amount1);\n232:     }\n```\n\n**Impacts** (High Severity):\n- **LP Dilution**: Phantom mints dilute existing LPs (e.g., ~0.01% per small exploit).\n\n\n**Vulnerability Flow** (Simplified PoC Math, 10e18 Swap Input; Assumes Symmetric Fees, Initial Reserves=100e18, TotalSupply=100e18):\n1. Swap 10e18 token0 in → ~9.066e18 token1 out; accrues fee0=1e16 (0.1% of input, prorated by launchpad LP share ~100%).\n   - Balances: token0=110e18, token1=90.93e18.\n   - Reserves: token0=109.99e18 (excludes fee0), token1=90.93e18.\n   - Accrued: fee0=1e16, fee1=0 (same block, no distribution).\n\n2. Immediate second swap (same block): 10e18 token1 in → ~10.86e18 token0 out; accrues fee1=1e16.\n   - Balances: token0=99.13e18, token1=100.93e18.\n   - Reserves: token0=99.12e18 (excludes total fee0=1.001e16), token1=100.92e18 (excludes fee1=1e16).\n   - Accrued: fee0=1.001e16, fee1=1e16.\n\n3. Attacker calls `mint(attacker)` (no tokens transferred in).\n   - Excess: amount0=balance0 - reserve0 = 1.001e16; amount1=1e16.\n   - Liquidity minted = min(1.001e16 * 100e18 / 99.12e18, 1e16 * 100e18 / 100.92e18) ≈ 9.908e15 LP tokens (pro-rata \"free\" share).\n   - Attacker now holds 9.908e15 LP tokens.\n\n4. Attacker transfers 9.908e15 LP to pair; calls `burn(attacker)`.\n   - Burn calc: amount0Burn = 9.908e15 * 99.13e18 / (100e18 + 9.908e15) ≈ 9.821e15 (pro-rata full balance0).\n   - amount1Burn ≈ 9.999e15 (pro-rata full balance1).\n   - Transfers ~9.821e15 token0 and ~9.999e15 token1 to attacker (≈ accrued fees, minor rounding from skew).\n\n## Recommended mitigation steps\n\nAnywhere `.balanceOf()` is read, account for `accrued fees` too",
